{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> About this game </h2><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336520/extras/car.png?t=1708047250\" /><br>Welcome to the Utopian world of dreams 1+1&lt;2<br>Class is rigid here, but there are few risk-takers<br>There is no freedom here, because there is only obedience<br>Everything here is in order<br>If you don't want to be someone else's tool, it's worth the risk<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336520/extras/1gif.gif?t=1708047250\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Is it bad to dream all the time?<br>Beautiful dream, but someone broke in<br>You're running away from here, or you're not<br>Someone you love in the dream, staying here all the time<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336520/extras/2gif.gif?t=1708047250\" /><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> Can't understand what I'm saying? </h2>The game is a story game without words, no matter what country you are the player can easily pick up this game.<br>The game is a classic horizontal puzzle game, but you can turn into Superman at certain moments in the game, and solve puzzles with pause time and instant time backwards<br>There are certain levels in the game where you need to solve puzzles together with characters of certain abilities<br>The game is very humane, there are a lot of save points, explore the scene to find decorations and jump keys to add interest<br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336520/extras/3gif.gif?t=1708047250\" /></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2336520?t=1708047250","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2336520/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1708047250","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/233652